# Files that run inside Linux (the Docker image, cron, docker-entrypoint.sh) keep LF line endings in every checkout,
# including Windows ones with core.autocrlf=true: a CRLF shebang cannot run, and the Dockerfile's exact-match
# `grep -qx` on requirements.pyretechnics.txt fails on a trailing \r.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
requirements*.txt text eol=lf
